ILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">전공, 성별 무관</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"39\" valign=\"center\" rowspan=\"2\" width=\"79\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><font color=\"#f70e1a\">선착순<br>마감</font></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"19\" valign=\"center\" width=\"92\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">(주)웰코</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"19\" valign=\"center\" width=\"99\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">2명</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"19\" valign=\"center\" width=\"207\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #282828; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">전공 무관(남학생에 한함)</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><font size=\"2\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><strong>&nbsp; <!--StartFragment-->※ (주)웰코&nbsp;<br></strong><font color=\"#0000ff\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 2008년 1월 설립된 연매출 100억원 규모의 우량중소기업<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;- 대졸신입연봉 2,650만원<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; -&nbsp;주생산품 : 코팅필름 제조업<br>&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 기타사항 : 기숙사 제공(취업시), 기술연구소 운영, 주5일 근무<br></font></span></font></font></p><p><font size=\"2\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#0000ff\"><br></font></span></font></font><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">■ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><strong>연수기간</strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> : <strong><font color=\"#7c84ef\">2012. 7. 23(월) ~ 8. 22(수)</font></strong> (1개월)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">■ <strong>연수시간</strong></span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> : 주5일, 1일 8시간 근무</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">■ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><strong>대&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 상</strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> : 학부재학생(3학년 이상, 29세 이하)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 제외대상</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 과거 3년간 직장체험 연수 경력이 있는 자</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(통산 연수기간이 2개월 미만의 단기연수자는 3년이 지나지 않아도</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1회에 한하여 참여 가능(사업연도를 달리해야 함))</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 법령상 이수토록 되어있는 현장실습에 참가중인 자</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 취업상태에 있는 자(고용보험 피보험자)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 대한민국 국적을 보유하지 않은 외국인</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">■ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><strong>신청방법</strong> </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;① </span><span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">원스톱서비스 온라인 신청</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;☞ 원스톱서비스 접속/ 로그인 / 학사관리 / 산업체현장실습메뉴 활용</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><a href=\"http://kumohweb.kumoh.ac.kr/mybsvr/login/onestop.html\" target=\"_self\"><u><font color=\"#810081\">http://kumohweb.kumoh.ac.kr/mybsvr/login/onestop.html</font></u></a></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">) </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;② </span><span style=\"COLOR: #ff0000; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">연수신청서(붙임서식) 취업지원본부 제출</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 위의 ①, ②항이 모두 이루어져야 신청이 완료됨</span></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;</span></span>&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">■ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><strong>연수생 사전교육</strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> : 2012.7.11(수) 13시(예정)(교내에서 진행)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">■ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><strong>연수생 특전</strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> : 연수수당 40만원 지급, 2학점 인정 </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">■ <strong>학점인정 관련 의무사항</strong></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1) 원스톱서비스 입력사항 : 현장실습일지(매일), 결과보고서(연수 완료 후)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 수강신청</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#ffccff\" height=\"39\" valign=\"center\" width=\"63\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">대 상</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"39\" valign=\"center\" width=\"421\"><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;청년직장체험프로그램 연수를 수료한 자</span><br><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;(결근 등으로 인하여 근무시간이 160시간 미만일 경우 학점인정 불가)</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#ffccff\" height=\"20\" valign=\"center\" width=\"63\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">시 기</span></span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"20\" valign=\"center\" width=\"421\"><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;2012년도 2학기 수강신청기간 내</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#ffccff\" height=\"16\" valign=\"center\" width=\"63\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">방 법</span></p></td><td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" height=\"16\" valign=\"center\" width=\"421\"><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;개인별 원스톱서비스 입력</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">(방학중 현장실습 선택) </span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p>&nbsp;</p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><p><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;</font></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">■ <strong>성적평가 및 학점인정 절차</strong></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1) 종합평가서 입력 : 실습일지, 결과보고서, 업체평가서 참조하여 지도교수가 원스톱서비스에서 입력</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 성적평가 : 해당 지도교수가 성적 평가[이수(S), 미이수(U)로 평가],</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2012년 2학기 성적으로 등재</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3) 학점인정 : 성적입력기간 중 지도교수가 입력(S, U로 표기)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;☞ 방학중 현장실습 : 2학점(전공선택)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;4) 휴학생 학점인정 : 휴학생은 복학하는 당해 학기에 수강신청</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">■ </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><strong>문 의 처</strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> : 취업지원본부(478-7984)</span></p></span></div></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
